@startuml
archimate #Motivation "Board" as stake <<motivation-stakeholder>>
archimate #Motivation "Growth" as goal <<motivation-goal>>
archimate #Motivation "Halve churn" as outcome <<motivation-outcome>>
archimate #Strategy "Retention" as cap <<strategy-capability>>
archimate #Implementation "Loyalty program" as wp <<implementation-workpackage>>
stake --> goal
goal --> outcome
outcome --> cap
cap --> wp
@enduml
